# Cloudflare's published address ranges (T-930, D-112): the only addresses the
# origin answers. Imported by deploy/Caddyfile; each line is one `remote_ip`
# range, and Caddy merges repeated `remote_ip` lines into one matcher.
#
# Copied from https://www.cloudflare.com/ips-v4 and
# https://www.cloudflare.com/ips-v6 on 2026-09-30.
#
# The API's watchdog compares this list with Cloudflare's published one once a
# week (condition `cloudflare_ranges`) and raises an alert when they differ.
# To update: edit the lines here AND the same list in
# apps/api/src/modules/watchdog/internal/cloudflare-ranges.ts (a unit test
# fails while the two disagree), then deploy and recreate Caddy
# (docs/09-deploy.md, "Only Cloudflare reaches the origin").
